This is a [Next.js](https://nextjs.org) project bootstrapped with [`create-next-app`](https://nextjs.org/docs/app/api-reference/cli/create-next-app).

## What this project is
- A Next.js-based UI application (likely an e-commerce or expert system front-end named BAC-EXPERT_BOT).
- Contains pages and components built with the App Router (or Pages Router) depending on the Next.js version used.

## Requirements
- Node.js (>= 16)
- npm, yarn, or pnpm

## Quick start (development)
1. Install dependencies
```bash
npm install
# or
# yarn
# pnpm install
```
2. Run development server
```bash
npm run dev
```
3. Open in browser
```
http://localhost:3000
```

## Build & production
```bash
npm run build
npm start
# or
# npm run start (as configured)
```

## Deployment
- This app can be deployed to Vercel for best compatibility with Next.js, or any Node.js hosting platform that supports Next.js builds.

## Contributing
- Open an issue or PR with clear steps to reproduce bugs or the feature you want to add.

## License
Add a LICENSE file (e.g., MIT) if you want to release this project under an open-source license.
